            <ArticleTitle>Pneumomediastinum associated with orbital fracture. Case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>249-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case report of pneumomediastinum secondary to a fracture of the orbital floor without injury to the chest is presented. The clinical entity is reviewed, and its clinical and anaesthesiological implications are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
